<presentation id="ZhwysBt6ylZ504dJoNFmFOEKy1g" xmlns="https://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0" width="960" height="540"><title>可验证的重分句鲁棒性评估_SemStamp与SimMark研究结论_Q-W</title><theme><textStyles><headline fontColor="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)"/><sub-headline fontColor="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)"/><body fontColor="rgba(31, 35, 41, 1)"/><caption fontColor="rgba(155, 158, 162, 1)" fontSize="14"/></textStyles></theme><slide id="phh"><style><fill id="fhh"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="700" height="26" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="127" type="text" id="bSS"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>CERTIFIED-RESEGMENTATION · PLAN Q–W · RESEARCH FINDINGS</p></content></shape><shape width="820" height="120" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="260" type="text" id="bSR"><content textType="title" fontSize="48" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25" textAlign="left"><p>可验证的重分句鲁棒性评估</p></content></shape><shape width="800" height="52" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="380" type="text" id="bSD"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="24" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="left"><p>SemStamp / SimMark exact-resegmentation：结论、证据与边界</p></content></shape><line id="bSG" startX="78" startY="470" endX="320.0020661068826" endY="470"><border color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)"/></line><shape width="700" height="26" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="492" type="text" id="bSn"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" textAlign="left"><p>汇报人：quzehao · 实验室周会 · 2026.10.10</p></content></shape></data><note id="bSc"><content><p>这份 PPT 讲 Q 到 W 的科研结论，不是过程流水账。一句话概括：句级语义水印的重分句鲁棒性，&quot;能精确评估&quot;已经做到，&quot;真实系统评估&quot;尚未完成。</p><p>对象是 SemStamp 和 SimMark 两个公开句级语义水印系统，方法是 exact-resegmentation：给定重分句预算，精确求最坏检测分数。</p><p>全篇围绕四个科研结论展开：算法可判定、接口可复现、归因需要健康基线、最终状态如实保留。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="phi"><style><fill id="fhi"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bSO"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>01 · FINDINGS · 结论先行</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="52" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bSd"><content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25" textAlign="left"><p>四条科研结论：能评估什么，做到了什么，什么没有做到</p></content></shape><line id="bSa" startX="60" startY="124" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="124"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="56" height="56" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="152" type="text" id="bSl"><content fontSize="30" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>01</p></content></shape><shape width="770" height="60" topLeftX="130" topLeftY="152" type="text" id="bSk"><content fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" textAlign="left"><p><strong>最坏情况可以精确评估。</strong>给定词序、单位数与重分句预算，全部合法重分句的检测统计量最坏值可精确求解，统计流程可 fail-closed。</p></content></shape><shape width="770" height="26" topLeftX="130" topLeftY="212" type="text" id="bST"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" textAlign="left"><p>证据：两代 DP 与暴力 oracle 全一致；合成校准 99,980 null、80 个统计门全过</p></content></shape><line id="bSX" startX="60" startY="252" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="252"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.12)" width="1"/></line><shape width="56" height="56" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="266" type="text" id="bSA"><content fontSize="30" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>02</p></content></shape><shape width="770" height="60" topLeftX="130" topLeftY="266" type="text" id="bSC"><content fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" textAlign="left"><p><strong>官方接口可复现，且同属一类检测器。</strong>SemStamp / SimMark 在隔离环境与官方逐项一致，数学上都是一阶相邻跨度检测器；工程上限在算力预算，不在算法。</p></content></shape><shape width="770" height="26" topLeftX="130" topLeftY="326" type="text" id="bSF"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" textAlign="left"><p>证据：SemStamp 258 / SimMark 240 等价门全一致；逐版本排除工程假设后瓶颈落在 GPU 小时</p></content></shape><line id="bSo" startX="60" startY="366" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="366"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.12)" width="1"/></line><shape width="56" height="56" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="380" type="text" id="bSu"><content fontSize="30" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false"><p>03</p></content></shape><shape width="770" height="60" topLeftX="130" topLeftY="380" type="text" id="bSZ"><content fontSize="17" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" textAlign="left"><p><strong>归因需要健康基线。</strong>SimMark 公开资产本身不健康，其证书下降不可归因于重分句；SemStamp 在重建资产上 detector health 通过。</p></content></shape><shape width="770" height="26" topLeftX="130" topLeftY="440" type="text" id="bSt"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" textAlign="left"><p>证据：SimMark clean positive 仅 89/1,000、FPR 9.25%；SemStamp 重建 1,000 条身份零重叠 positive</p></content></shape><line id="bSs" startX="60" startY="480" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="480"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="32" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="494" type="text" id="bSQ"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">04</span></strong>　<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">最终状态如实保留：</span></strong>SemStamp B0 健康门通过（FPR 上界 5.95%、TPR 下界 94.16%），但 B1 exact-certificate 因容量与预算门未执行——<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">真实系统的 certificate 鲁棒率尚未获得，如实报告为未完成</span></strong>。</p></content></shape></data><note id="bSH"><content><p>这一页是全篇的摘要，四条结论先行。</p><p>第一条：算法层面，重分句最坏情况可以精确评估，统计流程能 fail-closed。</p><p>第二条：两个系统接口可复现、属于同一类检测器，真正的瓶颈是算力。</p><p>第三条：归因必须建立在健康基线上，SimMark 不健康所以不可归因，SemStamp 重建后健康。</p><p>第四条：最终 B0 健康通过、B1 证书未执行，真实系统的鲁棒率如实保留为未完成。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="phw"><style><fill id="fhw"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bSz"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>02 · RESEARCH QUESTION · 研究问题与定位</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="52" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bSL"><content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25" textAlign="left"><p>研究问题：重分句鲁棒性，能否被可验证地评估</p></content></shape><line id="bSI" startX="60" startY="124" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="124"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="152" type="text" id="bSV"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>不是再找一个攻击方法</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="194" type="text" id="bSM"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">初步假设</span></strong>：句级语义水印普遍依赖 unitization（分割单元化），重分句是系统性的脆弱面。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">审计结果</span></strong>：AliMark 已把 split/merge 与重构对齐列为核心问题；SwordStamp 已覆盖 rewording / reordering / resegmentation 与子句检测。<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">继续做普通重分句实验没有增量，广义依赖 No-Go。</span></strong></p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="152" type="text" id="bSP"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>收窄为可验证的证书问题</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="194" type="text" id="bSW"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">保留的切口</span></strong>：固定词序、固定单位数与边界移动预算 k，对<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">全部合法重分句</span></strong>求检测统计量的最坏值，并给出可验证的鲁棒性证书。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">定位</span></strong>：与 SWAN 主证据流独立；研究同一个句级分割接口，为&quot;鲁棒性可被精确评估&quot;提供方法学证据。</p></content></shape><line id="bSU" startX="60" startY="470" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="470"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="44" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="482" type="text" id="bSh"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">一句话定位</span></strong>：我们不是报告&quot;我们又攻破了哪个水印&quot;，而是问——<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">&quot;重分句威胁&quot;能不能被精确、可验证、可复现地评估</span></strong>，并在两个真实系统上检验评估本身是否成立。</p></content></shape><line id="bSB" startX="60" startY="506" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="506"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="20" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bSY"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)"><p>来源：叙事.md Plan Q；系统检索 2026-09-22</p></content></shape></data><note id="bSi"><content><p>先讲清楚研究问题。我们最初想问句级语义水印是否普遍依赖分割单元化。</p><p>审计发现 AliMark 和 SwordStamp 已经把拆分合并、重分句、子句检测都做过了，普通实验没有增量，广义假设裁为 No-Go。</p><p>于是问题收窄成：给定词序、单位数和移动预算，能否对所有合法重分句求最坏检测分数，并给出可验证证书。</p><p>这决定了整条证据流不是&quot;找攻击&quot;，而是&quot;评估方法学&quot;。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="pht"><style><fill id="fht"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bSp"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>03 · FINDING 1 · 算法可判定性</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="70" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bSK"><content textType="headline" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="left"><p>结论一：重分句的最坏情况可以精确求解，且统计流程 fail-closed</p></content></shape><line id="bSf" startX="60" startY="142" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="142"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bSb"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>证据 A · 算法与暴力求解完全一致</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bSE"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">两代 DP 对暴力 oracle</span></strong>：独立跨度 additive DP 核对 36,824 个合法划分；一阶相邻跨度 edge-state DP 通过 5,669 系统 + 2,000 随机 + 1,000 退化实例——<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">全部一致</span></strong>。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">规模上限</span></strong>：300-token、k=3 精确覆盖 14,606,509 个划分，最慢运行 0.81s，远低于 10s 门。</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bSq"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>证据 B · 统计校准在合成 null 上闭合</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bSe"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">99,980 篇合成 null</span></strong>，post-certificate split-conformal 校准 + 严格 ties + 独立 test 单侧 Clopper–Pearson 审计。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">80 个统计门全过</span></strong>，最大单侧 95% FPR 上界 7.465%，低于 8% Stop 门；raw 阈值不会放大最小化证书的 FPR。</p></content></shape><line id="bSx" startX="60" startY="430" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="430"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="56" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="446" type="text" id="bSv"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">边界</span></strong>：这是合成与软件证据——它证明&quot;<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">能精确评估</span></strong>&quot;，不证明任何真实系统的鲁棒率。真实 watermarked positive 是否会得到空洞证书，仍需真实系统检验（对应裁决 CR01 / CR02 / CR03：支持）。</p></content></shape><line id="bSw" startX="60" startY="506" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="506"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="20" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bSg"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)"><p>来源：certified_resegmentation_preflight1 / pairwise_preflight1 / calibration_preflight1 结论文件</p></content></shape></data><note id="bSm"><content><p>结论一回答&quot;能不能精确评估&quot;。两代动态规划与暴力枚举逐项一致，说明算法本身可靠。</p><p>统计部分在 99,980 篇合成 null 上 80 个门全过，最大 FPR 上界 7.465%，低于 8% 停止门。</p><p>所以要强调的是：这证明评估方法本身可判定、可 fail-closed，但还不是真实系统的鲁棒率。</p><p>对应证据裁决是 CR01、CR02、CR03 支持。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="phM"><style><fill id="fhM"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bSy"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>04 · FINDING 2 · 接口与可实现性</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="70" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bSj"><content textType="headline" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="left"><p>结论二：官方接口可复现、同属一类；工程上限在算力，不在算法</p></content></shape><line id="bRR" startX="60" startY="142" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="142"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bRG"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>证据 A · 隔离环境逐项复现</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bRc"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">RTX 3090 隔离环境</span></strong>，代码/数据/权重/环境逐项 SHA 核验、身份去重与角色零交集。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">SemStamp 258 个等价门</span></strong>（unit/region/mask/hit/z-score）、<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">SimMark 240 个等价门</span></strong>（预处理/cosine/soft count/z-score）<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">全部一致</span></strong>。</p><p>接口审计同时确认：两系统数学上都是<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">一阶相邻跨度 pair-score 之和</span></strong>，属同一检测器类。</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bSr"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>证据 B · 逐层排除工程假设</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bSJ"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p>逐版本隔离 adapter、Python 状态管理、pair 物化、batch 并行、跨文档复用——<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">均被排除或不足以补足缺口</span></strong>。</p><p>最终外推预算 22.44 / 71.81 GPU-hours，超过 48h 门；<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">真正限制是算力预算，不是算法正确性</span></strong>。</p></content></shape><line id="bRS" startX="60" startY="430" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="430"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="56" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="446" type="text" id="bRD"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">边界</span></strong>：接口可复现<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">不等于 detector 健康</span></strong>；SimMark 早期等价仅以 gamma=0.5 sentinel 验证实现，未写成正式参数。对应裁决 CR04（接口类）、CR05（编译核心）支持。</p></content></shape><line id="bRn" startX="60" startY="506" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="506"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="20" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bRV"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)"><p>来源：叙事.md Plan S / Plan T；CR04、CR05</p></content></shape></data><note id="bSN"><content><p>结论二回答&quot;评估在真实系统上是否可做&quot;。SemStamp 258 个门、SimMark 240 个门全部与官方一致，复现成立。</p><p>接口审计还确认两系统数学上是同一类：一阶相邻跨度 pair score 之和，我们的 edge-state DP 正好适用。</p><p>资源工程逐层排除 adapter、状态、pair 物化、batch、复用，最后外推预算超过门，说明瓶颈是算力。</p><p>边界要讲清楚：复现一致不等于 detector 健康，SimMark 早期等价只是 sentinel 验证。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="phX"><style><fill id="fhX"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bRW"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>05 · FINDING 3 · 可归因性</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="70" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bRU"><content textType="headline" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="left"><p>结论三：归因需要健康基线——SimMark 不可归因，SemStamp 重建后健康</p></content></shape><line id="bRh" startX="60" startY="142" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="142"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bRM"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>SimMark：公开资产不健康，结论不可用</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bRY"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p>长跑后：官方 histogram 得 <strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">gamma=0.0</span></strong>；clean-positive 基线仅 <strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">89/1,000（8.9%）</span></strong>；k=1 test FPR <strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">9.25%</span></strong>——四项主门失败。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">攻击前 detector 已经不健康，任何 certificate 下降都不能归因于重分句</span></strong>（对应 CR06：不支持）。</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bRP"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>SemStamp：重建资产后健康可通过</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bRz"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p>从固定数据 shard 重建：<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">1,000 条 positive，身份零重叠，H0 通过</span></strong>；P0 健康前置显示 clean positive 974/999。</p><p>首次 test FPR 上界 10.88% &gt; 8% 时按预注册<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">预期早停</span></strong>，certificate 保持 0 篇——门先于计算，失败被如实保留。</p></content></shape><line id="bRL" startX="60" startY="430" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="430"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="56" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="446" type="text" id="bRI"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">科研含义</span></strong>：大规模计算本身不是研究进展；<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">&quot;重分句导致鲁棒性下降&quot;这类主张，必须先有健康的 detector 基线才能归因</span></strong>——这也是&quot;资产健康优先&quot;方法论的确立。</p></content></shape><line id="bRq" startX="60" startY="506" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="506"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="20" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bRB"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)"><p>来源：叙事.md Plan U / Plan V；CR06</p></content></shape></data><note id="bRi"><content><p>结论三讲归因。SimMark 的公开资产长跑后被发现不健康：clean positive 只有 89 条，FPR 9.25%，所以它的任何证书下降都不能归因于重分句。</p><p>SemStamp 走另一条路：重建 1,000 条身份零重叠的 positive，健康前置通过。</p><p>中间还发生一次预期早停：FPR 上界超 8% 门，按预注册条件停止，没有强行跑完。</p><p>科研含义是方法论：归因必须先有健康基线，计算规模本身不构成进展。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="phe"><style><fill id="fhe"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bRm"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>06 · FINDING 4 · 最终状态</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="70" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bRp"><content textType="headline" fontSize="28" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.3" textAlign="left"><p>结论四：B0 健康门通过，B1 证书按资源门未执行</p></content></shape><line id="bRK" startX="60" startY="142" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="142"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bRf"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>B0 · 正式 detector health（Go）</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bRb"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p>冻结 calibration null 1,000 + 独立 test null 1,000 + 重建 positive 1,000；阈值取 calibration 第 951 顺序统计量。</p><p>test FPR 47/1,000，<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">单侧 CP95 上界 5.95%</span></strong>；positive TPR 954/1,000，<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">单侧 CP95 下界 94.16%</span></strong>。</p><p>6,000 次评分 476.90s，双 replay 逐字一致、最大误差 0 → <strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">Go，仅授权另立 B1</span></strong>。</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="164" type="text" id="bRH"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>B1 · exact certificate（按门 Stop）</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="206" type="text" id="bRe"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p>唯一最大 calibration 样本 <strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">78,642,945 pruned pair</span></strong>，超单篇 50M 容量门；双 replay 外推 <strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">86.65 GPU-hours</span></strong>，超 72h 预算门。</p><p>正式裁决 <strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">STOPPED / Not started</span></strong>，score/certificate 调用全为 0；独立 auditor 复算后 pass/stop。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">证明的是实现与预算不足，不是 SemStamp 在重分句下不鲁棒</span></strong>。</p></content></shape><line id="bRx" startX="60" startY="430" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="430"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="56" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="446" type="text" id="bRv"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.45" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">裁决与边界</span></strong>：CR07（SemStamp 最终 health）<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">支持</span></strong>；CR08（SemStamp exact certificate 鲁棒率）<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">未执行/不支持</span></strong>。不创建 v19、不删除超限样本、不放宽门——<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">把 Stop 说清楚，不包装成成功</span></strong>。</p></content></shape><line id="bRw" startX="60" startY="506" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="506"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="20" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="514" type="text" id="bRg"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)"><p>来源：叙事.md Plan W；CR07、CR08</p></content></shape></data><note id="bRE"><content><p>结论四是最终状态。B0 是正式的 detector health：FPR 上界 5.95%、TPR 下界 94.16%，双 replay 全一致，判 Go。</p><p>B1 是 exact certificate：最大样本 7,864 万 pruned pair 超 50M 容量门，外推 86.65 GPU 小时超 72 小时门，判 Stop。</p><p>关键区分：B1 Stop 证明的是当前实现与预算不足，不等于 SemStamp 在重分句下不鲁棒。</p><p>所以最终证据裁决 CR07 支持、CR08 未执行，真实系统的 certificate 鲁棒率如实保留为未完成。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="phy"><style><fill id="fhy"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bDp"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>07 · EVIDENCE MATRIX · 支持与不支持的结论</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="52" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bRy"><content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25" textAlign="left"><p>证据裁决矩阵：六项支持、一项不支持、一项未执行</p></content></shape><line id="bDc" startX="60" startY="124" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="124"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><table id="bDz" width="840" height="300" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="150"><colgroup><col span="3" width="280"/></colgroup><tr height="33"><td id="bDm"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>CR</p></content></td><td id="bRN"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>主张</p></content></td><td id="bDG"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>裁决</p></content></td></tr><tr height="33"><td id="bDi"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR01</p></content></td><td id="bDq"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>独立跨度 additive DP 与暴力 oracle 精确一致</p></content></td><td id="bRQ"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" bold="true"><p>支持</p></content></td></tr><tr height="33"><td id="bDD"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR02</p></content></td><td id="bDY"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>一阶相邻跨度 edge-state DP 精确求解最坏划分</p></content></td><td id="bDh"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" bold="true"><p>支持</p></content></td></tr><tr height="33"><td id="bDv"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR03</p></content></td><td id="bRu"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>合成 null 统计校准 80 个门全过、FPR 上界受控</p></content></td><td id="bDR"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" bold="true"><p>支持</p></content></td></tr><tr height="33"><td id="bDS"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR04</p></content></td><td id="bDM"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>SemStamp / SimMark 官方接口可复现、属一阶相邻跨度类</p></content></td><td id="bDI"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" bold="true"><p>支持</p></content></td></tr><tr height="33"><td id="bRa"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR05</p></content></td><td id="bRA"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>factorized span-feature core 可处理最大已验证 shape</p></content></td><td id="bDB"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" bold="true"><p>支持</p></content></td></tr><tr height="33"><td id="bDU"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR06</p></content></td><td id="bDK"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>SimMark 已获得可解释的 certificate 鲁棒率</p></content></td><td id="bRs"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>不支持</p></content></td></tr><tr height="33"><td id="bRj"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR07</p></content></td><td id="bDV"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>SemStamp 最终 detector health（B0）通过</p></content></td><td id="bDL"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)" bold="true"><p>支持</p></content></td></tr><tr height="36"><td id="bDx"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)"><p>CR08</p></content></td><td id="bRo"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)"><p>SemStamp exact certificate 鲁棒率（B1）</p></content></td><td id="bRJ"><content fontSize="13" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" bold="true"><p>未执行</p></content></td></tr></table><line id="bDe" startX="60" startY="474" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="474"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="44" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="488" type="text" id="bRr"><content fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">整体判断</span></strong>：方法学结论全部成立（能精确评估）；系统层面只获得健康性结论（CR07），<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">没有获得任何真实系统的 certificate 鲁棒率</span></strong>（CR06 不支持、CR08 未执行）。</p></content></shape><line id="bDn" startX="60" startY="518" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="518"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="14" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="524" type="text" id="bDP"><content textType="caption" fontSize="11" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)"><p>来源：CLAIM_EVIDENCE_MATRIX.md</p></content></shape></data><note id="bDW"><content><p>这一页是证据裁决矩阵，直接回答&quot;哪些主张被支持&quot;。CR01 到 CR05 是方法学，全部支持。</p><p>CR06 SimMark 获得可解释鲁棒率，不支持——因为资产不健康，不可归因。</p><p>CR07 SemStamp 最终健康通过，支持。CR08 exact certificate，未执行。</p><p>整体判断一句话：方法学成立，系统只有健康性、没有鲁棒率。</p></content></note></slide><slide id="phn"><style><fill id="fhn"><fillColor color="rgba(244, 246, 241, 1)"/></fill></style><data><shape width="840" height="24" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="36" type="text" id="bRX"><content textType="caption" fontSize="12" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(122, 138, 125, 1)" letterSpacing="2" wrap="false"><p>08 · SYNTHESIS · 与 SWAN 证据流统一</p></content></shape><shape width="840" height="52" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="64" type="text" id="bRk"><content textType="headline" fontSize="30" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true" lineSpacing="multiple:1.25" textAlign="left"><p>同一分割接口的两条证据流，进入同一篇投稿</p></content></shape><line id="bRZ" startX="60" startY="124" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="124"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="152" type="text" id="bRT"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>两条证据流的关系</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="194" type="text" id="bRF"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">SWAN 行为审计（Plan A–P）</span></strong>：句界诱因、A-B-A 干预、正例工程的结论链。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">certificate 评估（Plan Q–W）</span></strong>：本份 PPT，重分句鲁棒性的可验证评估方法学。</p><p>两者研究<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">同一个句级分割接口</span></strong>，证据隔离、<strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">不互相补证</span></strong>。</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="30" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="152" type="text" id="bRd"><content textType="sub-headline" fontSize="18" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" bold="true"><p>科研贡献与终态</p></content></shape><shape width="400" height="200" topLeftX="500" topLeftY="194" type="text" id="bRl"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77, 90, 83, 1)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.6" textAlign="left"><p><strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">贡献</span></strong>：把&quot;重分句鲁棒性&quot;从攻击叙事转为可验证的评估方法学——算法可判定、统计 fail-closed、复现与归因规则完整。</p><p><strong><span color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)">终态</span></strong>：统一进入一篇 TMLR 匿名稿；实验全部停止、远端无活动进程；P0 保存 39,457 个文件哈希。</p></content></shape><line id="bRC" startX="60" startY="430" endX="900.0005952378843" endY="430"><border color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 0.2)" width="1"/></line><shape width="840" height="70" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="446" type="text" id="bRO"><content fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42, 45, 48, 1)" textAlign="left"><p><strong>收束</strong>：这份证据流能说的结论都说清楚了——<strong><span color="rgba(76, 122, 90, 1)">&quot;重分句鲁棒性可以被精确评估&quot;成立；&quot;SemStamp 在重分句下到底多鲁棒&quot;仍未完成</span></strong>，后者被如实保留为未完成项，进入投稿的 Limitations。</p></content></shape></data><note id="bRt"><content><p>最后一页把这条证据流放回整体。SWAN 审计和 certificate 评估研究同一个句级分割接口，但证据隔离、互不补证。</p><p>贡献是把重分句鲁棒性从攻击叙事转成可验证的评估方法学：算法可判定、统计可 fail-closed、复现和归因规则完整。</p><p>终态：统一进入一篇 TMLR 匿名稿，实验全部停止，远端无活动进程。</p><p>收束一句话：能说的结论说清楚，没做完的如实保留，写进 Limitations。</p></content></note></slide></presentation>